extends layout

block content
  .page-heading
    div
      h1 Statement imports
      p Add P&N bank history from OFX exports. You'll review every account before anything is imported.
  form#ofx-upload.upload-zone
    label.form-label(for='ofx-files') OFX or QFX files
    input#ofx-files.form-control(type='file' accept='.ofx,.qfx' multiple required)
    p.form-text Up to 10 files, 5 MB each and 8 MB in total. Overlapping exports are fine.
    button.btn.btn-primary.mt-2(type='submit') Preview files
  details.help
    summary How imports work
    ul
      li Statements you've imported before are recognised automatically, and only new transactions are added.
      li First time for an account? Start with the oldest history you want to keep. To add to an Actual account that already has history, select it and choose the date to import from.
      li Loans usually belong off-budget, and money owed should be negative.
      li Existing accounts keep their opening balance and budget status. New accounts get an opening balance calculated from the statement.
      li Transfers are matched using shared P&N references. For Up transfers, choose any linked Up account or limit matching to one account. Only unique matches with a bank-identifying description are linked automatically; others remain for review. Future Up syncs also check for matches.
  #ofx-status.mt-3(role='status' aria-live='polite')
  form#ofx-confirm.mt-4(hidden)
    #ofx-accounts
    button#ofx-import.btn.btn-primary(type='submit') Import
  #ofx-result.mt-4

block scripts
  script(src='/ofx.js')
